WEBVTT

00:03:28.727 --> 00:03:31.631
"Before I die, I want
to live off the grid."

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:36.822
"Before I die, I want
to hold her one more time."

00:03:39.779 --> 00:03:43.359
"Before I die, I want
to be someone's cavalry."

00:03:45.565 --> 00:03:50.093
"Before I die, I want
to be completely myself."

00:03:53.971 --> 00:03:57.946
So this neglected space
became a constructive one,

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:02.842
and people's hopes and dreams
made me laugh out loud, tear up,